DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:Silver130688@localhost:5432/postgres
SESSION_SECRET=a_very_long_and_random_secret_string
# Убедитесь, что переменная PORT не установлена на 5432
PORT=3000

The DATABASE_URL is the connection string to the PostgreSQL database. The SESSION_SECRET is a secret string used to sign the session cookie.
The .env file is used by the dotenv package to load environment variables into the Node.js application.
Create a new file named .env.example and copy the content of the .env file into it.

